        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid columns-3">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-heading">
        <h3 class="color-accent no-top-margin">
          Context Management
        </h3>
        <p class="paragraph s secondary">
